1
00:00:07,679 --> 00:00:09,639
- Oh. Oh. Shut the door, Shut the door.
- Why?

2
00:00:09,806 --> 00:00:11,386
(Penny:)Just do it.

3
00:00:15,645 --> 00:00:18,605
- Get inside and shut the door.
- Well, you didn't specify.

4
00:00:22,068 --> 00:00:24,908
- Is Leonard around?
- He went to the movies without me.

5
00:00:25,071 --> 00:00:27,411
(Sheldon:)It was the only option.

6
00:00:35,707 --> 00:00:38,997
I'm sorry, I don't know understand
which social situation this is.

7
00:00:39,169 --> 00:00:41,299
(Sheldon:)Could you give me some guidance
how to proceed?

8
00:00:41,462 --> 00:00:42,502
[SIGHS]

9
00:00:42,672 --> 00:00:44,922
(Penny:)The building manager's showing
an apartment downstairs...

10
00:00:45,091 --> 00:00:48,471
(Penny:)- ...and I haven't paid my rent.
- Oh, I see.

11
00:00:48,803 --> 00:00:50,803
I'm not comfortable harboring
a fugitive...

12
00:00:50,972 --> 00:00:53,852
(Sheldon:)...from the 2311
North Los Robles Corporation.

13
00:00:54,267 --> 00:00:56,807
(Penny:)It's no big deal.
I'm just a little behind on my bills.

14
00:00:56,978 --> 00:00:59,898
(Penny:)They cut back my hours
at the restaurant and my car broke down.

15
00:01:00,064 --> 00:01:01,274
(Sheldon:)If you recall...

